<doc id="99517" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99517" title="André Lwoff">
André Lwoff

André Michael Lwoff (&lt;a href="Ainay-le-Ch%C3%A2teau"&gt;Ainay-le-Château&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Allier"&gt;Allier&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="8%20M%C3%A8i"&gt;8 Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1902"&gt;1902&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="30%20September"&gt;30 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;) piyambakipun punika &lt;a href="ilmuwan"&gt;ilmuwan&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1921"&gt;1921&lt;/a&gt;, Lwoff turut sarta kaliyan &lt;a href="Institute%20Pasteur"&gt;Institute Pasteur&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun wisuda kanthi gelar &lt;a href="sains"&gt;sains&lt;/a&gt;
saking &lt;a href="Universitas%20Paris"&gt;Universitas Paris&lt;/a&gt;. Lwoff angsal gelar &lt;a href="dhokter"&gt;dhokter&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan gelar &lt;a href="Ph.D."&gt;Ph.D.&lt;/a&gt;
nalika taun &lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampunipun &lt;a href="PhD"&gt;PhD&lt;/a&gt;, Lwoff nelasaken wekdal kanggé sinau ngantos satunggal taun wonten &lt;a href="Heidelberg"&gt;Heidelberg&lt;/a&gt;
inggih punika wonten ing &lt;a href="laboratorium"&gt;laboratorium&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Otto%20Meyerhof"&gt;Otto Meyerhof&lt;/a&gt; (pamenang &lt;a href="Bebungah%20Nobel"&gt;Bebungah Nobel&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1922"&gt;1922&lt;/a&gt;). Nalika taun &lt;a href="1938"&gt;1938&lt;/a&gt;,
piyambakipun diangkat dados Kepala Pérangan wonten ing &lt;a href="Institut%20Pasteur"&gt;Institut Pasteur&lt;/a&gt;, wonten punika piyambakipun tetep wonten ing mrika ngantos akir taun &lt;a href="1950-an"&gt;1950-an&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1959"&gt;1959&lt;/a&gt;, Lwoff dados &lt;a href="Profesor"&gt;Profesor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Mikrobiologi"&gt;Mikrobiologi&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing &lt;a href="Sorbonne"&gt;Sorbonne&lt;/a&gt;, Paris.
Sasampunipun pensiun saking Institut Pasteur nalika taun &lt;a href="1968"&gt;1968&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun dados &lt;a href="direktur"&gt;direktur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Cancer%20Research%20Institute"&gt;Cancer Research Institute&lt;/a&gt; ngantos taun &lt;a href="1972"&gt;1972&lt;/a&gt;.
Piyambakipun angsal &lt;a href="Bebungah%20Nobel%20Fisiologi%20utawa%20Kedhokteran"&gt;Bebungah Nobel Fisiologi utawa Kedhokteran&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt;, sesarengan kaliyan &lt;a href="Francois%20Jacob"&gt;Francois Jacob&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Jacques%20Lucien%20Monod"&gt;Jacques Lucien Monod&lt;/a&gt;, amargi karya panalitèn pangaturan &lt;a href="gen"&gt;gen&lt;/a&gt;etik kaliyan sintesis, &lt;a href="enzim"&gt;enzim&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="virus"&gt;virus&lt;/a&gt;.
Kanthi cara sareng-sareng, kelompok punika saged mangertosi mekanisme, &lt;a href="lisogenik"&gt;lisogenik&lt;/a&gt; ingkang saged dipun-ginakaken virus kanggé njangkiti &lt;a href="bakt%C3%A8ri"&gt;baktèri&lt;/a&gt;.
Karyanipun Lwoff wataranipun inggih punika Prekawis Morfogenesis Siliata (&lt;a href="1950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt;) kaliyan Tatanan Biologis (&lt;a href="1962"&gt;1962&lt;/a&gt;).
Boten namung angsal &lt;a href="Bebungah%20Nobel"&gt;Bebungah Nobel&lt;/a&gt;, Lwoff mepunika anggota saking kelompok-kelompok ilmiah elit.
Piyambakipun punika anggota kehormatan &lt;a href="Harvey%20Society"&gt;Harvey Society&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="New%20York%20Academy%20of%20Sciences"&gt;New York Academy of Sciences&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt;),
&lt;a href="Royal%20Society%20of%20London"&gt;Royal Society of London&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1958"&gt;1958&lt;/a&gt;), kaliyan &lt;a href="American%20Academy%20of%20Arts%20and%20Sciences"&gt;American Academy of Arts and Sciences&lt;/a&gt; (1958).
