<doc id="99525" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99525" title="Kali Rhein">
Kali Rhein

Kali Rhein (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: Rhin, &lt;a href="Basa%20Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;: Rijn) kang dawané 1.230&amp;nbsp;km iku salah siji &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; paling dawa &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt;. Jenengé dijupuk saka &lt;a href="basa%20Keltik"&gt;Keltik&lt;/a&gt; "renos" (tegesé "arus kang dhuwur"). Bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Kali%20Donau"&gt;Kali Donau&lt;/a&gt; dadi wewatesan lor &lt;a href="Kamaharajan%20Romawi"&gt;Kamaharajan Romawi&lt;/a&gt; lan wiwit wektu iku wis dadi jalur banyu wigati kang bisa dilayari, kanggo dedagangan menyang laladan pedalaman.
<h2>Geografi</h2>
Geografi.
 Kali Rhein asalé saka Pagunungan &lt;a href="Alpen"&gt;Alpen&lt;/a&gt; ing Switserlan wewengkon &lt;a href="Graub%C3%BCnden"&gt;Graubünden&lt;/a&gt;. Vorderrhein (Rhein Ngarep) metu saka &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Tuma"&gt;Tlaga Tuma&lt;/a&gt; edhak &lt;a href="celah%20Oberalp"&gt;celah Oberalp&lt;/a&gt; lan ngliwati Ruinaulta (Tebing Besar Switserlan). Hinterrhein (Rhein belakang) wiwit saka gletser Firdaus cedhak Rheinquellhorn ing tapelwates kidul Switserlan. Kaloro anak kali mau ketemu ing cedhak &lt;a href="Reichenau"&gt;Reichenau&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Graubunden"&gt;Graubunden&lt;/a&gt;.
