Asteroid &lt;a href="1622%20Chacornac"&gt;1622 Chacornac&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan kawah &lt;a href="Chacornac%20%28kawah%29"&gt;Chacornac&lt;/a&gt; wonten &lt;a href="Rembulan"&gt;Rembulan&lt;/a&gt; dipunparingi nama sami kados ta namanipun Chacornac, panghormatan kanggé piyambakipun.
