<doc id="99573" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99573" title="Getsemani">
Getsemani

Getsemani (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: ΓεσΘημανι, Gesthēmani #ALIH‎
, &lt;a href="basa%20Aram"&gt;Aram&lt;/a&gt; גת שמנא, Gat Šmānê) iku sawijining taman ing sikil &lt;a href="bukit%20Zaitun"&gt;bukit Zaitun&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Yerusalem"&gt;Yerusalem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt; lan dipercaya minangka papan &lt;a href="Y%C3%A9sus"&gt;Yésus&lt;/a&gt; sembayang kang pungkasan dhéwé sadurungé &lt;a href="Panyaliban%20Yesus"&gt;kakisas&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Ètimologi</h2>
Ètimologi.
Tembung Gethsemane mijil ing Injil Matius lan Injil Markus abasa Yunani minangka Γεθσημανἱ (Gethsēmani). Tembung iki asalé saka Assyria ܓܕܣܡ (Gaṯ-Šmāne), kang tegesé “piranti pameres (pangasil) lenga”. &lt;a href="Injil%20Matius"&gt;Matius&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D26%2332"&gt;26:32&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Injil%20Markus"&gt;Markus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D14%2332"&gt;14:32&lt;/a&gt; nyebutaké χωρἰον (kho-ree'-on) utawa “panggonan”. Injil &lt;a href="Injil%20Yohanes"&gt;Yohanes&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D18%231"&gt;18:1&lt;/a&gt; nélakaké Yesus lumebu sawijining “taman” κῆπος (kēpos) bebarengan karo murid-murid Dalem.
<h2>Panggonan kusus</h2>
Panggonan kusus.
Adhedhasar Prajanjian Anyar, Taman Getsemani iku papan ing endi Yésus lan murid-murid Dalem asring sowan, kang nggampangaké &lt;a href="Yudas%20Iskariot"&gt;Yudas Iskariot&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nemu Yésus nalika &lt;a href="Panyekelan%20Y%C3%A9sus"&gt;wengi panyekelan Dalem&lt;/a&gt;. Adhedhasar &lt;a href="Injil%20Lukas"&gt;Lukas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D22%2343-44"&gt;22:43-44&lt;/a&gt;, ing kana Yésus banget girisé lan saya ngganter enggoné ndedonga. Riwéné nganti kaya getih tumètès ana ing bumi
." Kaanan iki sajeroning donya médhis ditepungi minangka &lt;a href="hematidrosis"&gt;hematidrosis&lt;/a&gt;.
